sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is Authorized
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is EVConnectedPreSession

    Note over CS,CSMS: 1. Execute Reusable State ISO15118SmartCharging

    Note over CS,CSMS: 2. The CSMS does NOT send a SetChargingProfileRequest
    Note over CSMS: Note: The CSMS must NOT initiate a renegotiate after starting the transaction, without cause.<br>For example, a smart charging algorithm or an external trigger, etc.
